<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Joel details hedging portfolio.</title>
<headline>Joel details hedging portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>JCI Ltd said on Tuesday that HJ Joel Gold Mining Co Ltd's hedging portfolio as at December 31, 1996 consisted of the following:</p>
<p>    1997			  Forward sales	    Put options</p>
<p>kilograms			 678			  140</p>
<p>ounces			    21,790		     4,500</p>
<p>weighted average</p>
<p> forward price (rand/kg)    57,209		     57,541</p>
<p>1998</p>
<p>kilograms			 719			  187</p>
<p>ounces			    23,120		     6,000</p>
<p>weighted average</p>
<p> forward price (rand/kg)    62,687		     61,059</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
